[[SECTION]]
TITLE: WAV File Handling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-013
TITLE: WAV File Input Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall support WAV files as audio input sources.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-014
TITLE: Audio Container Identification
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall identify WAV containers independently of the
codecs they contain.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-015
TITLE: WAV Format Identification
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall identify whether an input file uses the WAV container 
format.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-016
TITLE: WAV File Decoding
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall decode supported audio streams contained within WAV files 
into PCM audio samples.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-017
TITLE: WAV File Channel Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the number of audio channels from audio streams 
contained within WAV files.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-018
TITLE: WAV File Sample Rate Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the sample rate of audio streams contained within 
WAV files.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-019
TITLE: WAV File Bits Per Sample Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the number of bits per sample from audio streams 
contained within WAV files.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-003

